# 如何看返回值
# 1. 光标放在 POST 行 → Send Request（需安装 REST Client 扩展）
# 2. 响应在标签栏新标签（Response / 200）；若一闪就没了：已配置 .vscode/settings.json 禁止预览标签被顶掉，重载窗口后再试
# 3. 找历史响应：Cmd+Shift+P → Rest Client: Request History
# 4. 或终端：curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/bm25 -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"kbId":1,"query":"SMS_429","topK":5}'

### V4 全量重建 ES 索引
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/index/rebuild

### V4 BM25 检索 - SMS_429
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/bm25
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kbId": 1,
  "query": "SMS_429 是什么意思？",
  "topK": 5
}

### V4 BM25 检索 - send-code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/bm25
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kbId": 1,
  "query": "send-code 接口路径是什么？",
  "topK": 5
}

### V4 Debug 查询 - BM25 模式
POST http://localhost:8080/api/debug/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kbId": 1,
  "question": "SMS_429 是什么意思？",
  "topK": 5,
  "searchMode": "BM25"
}
